Package: OmixSeurat
Type: Package
Title: Seurat Donor-Level Aggregation Bridge for OMIX
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Margaret", "Cam", email = "maggie.cam@nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Margaret Cam [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Margaret Cam <maggie.cam@nih.gov>
Description: Extracts raw counts or declared continuous gene-expression layers
    and aligned cell metadata from Seurat objects, then creates donor-by-group
    summed-count or mean-expression profiles for OMIX modules.
